# Build context for infra/docker/Dockerfile: sources and lockfiles only.
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/target
**/*.tsbuildinfo
var
mods
deploy
supabase
docs
templates
tools
apps/iecode-dotnet
apps/cli

# Secrets never enter the context; build-time values come from the `rg_env` BuildKit secret.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.secrets
**/secrets
.claude
.vercel
